# .claude/CLAUDE.md is the tracked global instructions file; ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md
# is a local symlink to it, so Claude Code auto-loads it in every repo.

# Claude Code syncs account-level skills (claude.ai) into ~/.claude/skills/synced,
# which resolves into this repo through the ~/.claude/skills symlink. It is a
# per-machine cache with proprietary content and churns on every sync.
.claude/skills/synced/

# Skills removed from ~/.claude/skills (e.g. by a sync) are moved here rather
# than deleted; same proprietary content, same churn.
.claude/skills/.trash/
